---
description: PO-facing language is Russian. Agent prompts and commits stay English.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Language (hard)

- Questions, answers, reports, and blockers to the PO: Russian only.
- Never ask the PO a question in English. Voice-to-English input does not switch the reply.
- Agent-to-agent prompts inside a `text` fence: English only.
- Code, identifiers, branch names, and commit messages: English.
- A stop/routing reply is Russian and names the role chat that should receive the prompt.

Full policy: `.ai/shared/AGENT_LANGUAGE_POLICY.md`.
